@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor "Planner" as Planner
participant ":System" as System
participant "Station Index Trees\n(BST/AVL)" as Indexes
participant "Validation Log" as Log

activate Planner
Planner -> System : request station index loading (stations.csv)
activate System

System -> System : validate station record fields
alt Invalid record
    System -> Log : write validation error (name/country/tz/lat/lon issue)
    Log --> System : logged

else Valid record
    System -> Indexes : insert into\n• Latitude Tree\n• Longitude Tree\n• TimeZoneGroup Tree
    activate Indexes
    Indexes --> System : insertion ok
    deactivate Indexes
end

System --> Planner : all valid stations indexed
deactivate System

== Query Operations ==

Planner -> System : query stations by timeZoneGroup
activate System
System -> Indexes : search by TZ group
activate Indexes
Indexes --> System : sorted list (country ASC, name ASC)
deactivate Indexes
System --> Planner : display filtered list
deactivate System

Planner -> System : windowed TZ group query ([TZ_min..TZ_max])
activate System
System -> Indexes : range search in TZ tree
activate Indexes
Indexes --> System : sorted list\nTZ ASC → country ASC → name ASC
deactivate Indexes
System --> Planner : display results
deactivate System
deactivate Planner

@enduml

